# vBIOS ROM dumps: large binary blobs (~2MB each), card-specific per user.
# Each user dumps their own GPU's vBIOS into VBIOS/ for auto-injection; these
# are NOT source code and should not be version-controlled. The matcher reads
# the dump's own embedded PCI ID, so a non-matching dump is never used.
# Keep VBIOS/README.md tracked (it documents how to obtain a dump).
VBIOS/*.rom

# Fallback: ignore any stray *.rom anywhere else in the repo.
*.rom
